  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: primer. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Self-hosted Primer where a comment wakes the agent that wrote the document",
    "An agent bound to a channel keeps a short memory of it",
    "An agent revises the documents it published without an owner card",
    "An instance written for an older product compiles as it stands; the updater no longer rewrites modules:",
    "Create a repo in any github_orgs org the App is installed on, Tier 0",
    "The apply retires the old update units only after its health verdict",
    "The owner's own @mention shows as theirs, not \"Someone else\"",
    "A module's first deploy creates its data dir before recording data_version"
  ],
